  "verification_limits": [
    "Real ordinary N22 accounts, Human bodies and primary instances are reused. Capability merits and acquisition are explicit private fixture grants; natural prerequisite progression and affordability remain unqualified.",
    "Native stock wand and both private carriers keep 60 seconds per charge. The material carrier consumes one nearby tagged item per charge before timed work completes. These private definitions are not stock installer changes.",
    "Mend is the only payload produced/released. Other adapters, temporary-bonus/nonmonotonic reproduction and injected provider faults retain their stated managed/controlled-native scopes.",
    "The eighth replay cancelled its first paid batch after about 40 seconds while the harness issued no producer command; exact stopped-world audit confirms terminal no-charge/no-refund interruption and cleared reservation. The generic diagnostic discarded the predicate. A bounded temporary trace probe completed that batch without reproducing cancellation. Its precise cause remains undetermined. The diagnostic source was restored byte-for-byte and rebuilt/retested before final native acceptance. No diagnostic-probe counts qualify this milestone; every changing physical/policy input and N25 provider faults remain unqualified.",
    "The ninth replay completed all five batches, player cancellation and the forced-stop/cold-retention checks, then failed a harness response expectation. The code returns the earlier structural custody/bank/reservation refusal before the later reserved/staff-review message. The final harness matches that exact existing refusal for recharge and activation, retaining exact bank/player/journal invariance checks. The ninth replay remains failed and its counts are not added.",
    "The tenth replay stopped at fixture grants because the exact ninth-replay DeviceProducing operation quarantined the caster. A separate owned setup helper binds its operation/item/component/cost/owner/body through typed receipt fields and natively acknowledges only that operation as Reconciled. The full reserved bank, both player states and caster reserve 600 remain unchanged, with no refund/replay. Its reservation remains on the old fixture item. Initial helper failures occurred before MUD startup or acknowledgement and retain clean MySQL shutdown; these audits/setup outcomes add no native acceptance counts.",
    "The eleventh replay passed setup but failed before its first payment when a JSON journal observation could not parse. A stopped-world read of the same exact query returned 64 valid rows; stored-data corruption is not established and the original transport cause remains undetermined. The final Python harness retries only SELECT JSON observations, at most three attempts, retaining malformed row contents and hashes; a third malformed observation still fails. Gameplay/payment commands are never retried. This Python-only follow-up changes no managed CSharp input or runtime binary.",
    "The twelfth replay passed production, payment, cancellation, crash and cold reserved-item refusals, then incorrectly expected the crashed producer to release another stock item. Its unresolved operation correctly quarantined that producer's spell/trait/reserve inputs. The final scenario consumes the stock bank before deliberately establishing that unresolved quarantine. The exact failed operation is separately acknowledged for setup without changing its bank, reserved GUID, both player states or paid reserve 600. The final replay's incomplete work remains unresolved. The failed twelfth replay and setup acknowledgement add no acceptance counts.",
    "The wrong-type case is a real entitled capability with no Mend admission. A separate entitled, acquired, admitted alternate route legitimately succeeds; recorded original producer capability remains provenance, not a blanket identity lock.",
    "The reader Mend acquisition is captured and removed while stopped to establish the negative input, then natively granted. Original/weak/strong raw inputs 45/44/49 are below the unchanged native cap evaluated for each player through the engine trait-expression command and its exact expression FK. The bank records actual raw 45. Initial reserve 1000 is setup; the later 900-to-49 conditioning withdraws 851 and is never restored. No qualifying paid operation receives a refund.",
    "The first native weak-producer probe failed because database input 60 was clamped to native raw 50; reader input 59 legitimately qualified. That receipt remains failed. Its paid work was natively cancelled during disconnect, with the old charge retained, reservation cleared and debit preserved. An owned read-only audit and setup in retained failed replay 6 verify that terminal state without staff resolve. The final replay omits this optional prior-fixture check because subsequent failed attempts independently conditioned the reader reserve; it does not rewrite that balance to recreate the earlier audit. N22 input 60 likewise meant database input rather than uncapped runtime raw 60; its native receipt already records raw 50 and grade-three 18-point release result is unchanged.",
    "One owned MUD process is intentionally forcibly stopped during paid recharge. It is not a graceful shutdown pass. Five other server phases exit zero; all collectors and owned MySQL close. The stranded bank/reservation and unresolved receipt remain for explicit staff reconciliation.",
    "No runtime implementation, schema, blank snapshot, installer catalogue, stock capacity/timer or full Seeder changes. Whole-programme and Release gates remain false."
  ],
